# Committed JDK-only blocker baselines live here, one pair per JDK image:
#
#   jdk-<feature>-missing-natives.json
#   jdk-<feature>-synthetic-dependencies.json
#
# Generate them with:
#
#   python tools/jdk-only-blockers/blockers.py ... --update-baseline
#
# and commit the result. `--check` fails when the open blocker set grows
# against these files. There is intentionally no baseline in the tree yet:
# one must be produced from a real run of a real JDK image, never by hand.
